{"seq":2,"slug":"infrastructure","title":"基础设施与扩缩容","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-scaling-patterns","title":"服务器扩缩容模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/server-scaling-patterns","wordCount":1664,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"session-management","title":"会话管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/session-management","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"persistence-database","title":"持久化与数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-server-architecture/infrastructure/persistence-database","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础设施与扩缩容\">基础设施与扩缩容</h1><p>本章从单个服务器实例跃升到集群视角。当玩家数从百人增长到百万人，服务器不再是一个进程而是一个分布式系统——Fleet Manager 动态调度实例、Session 层管理玩家生命周期、持久化层保障数据不丢失。</p>\n<p>三篇文档覆盖扩缩容模式（横向扩展 vs 弹性伸缩 vs 区域部署）、会话管理（连接握手→断线重连→优雅迁移）、以及持久化数据库选型（关系型 vs NoSQL vs 混合方案在游戏场景中的取舍）。</p>\n"}